<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">

  <meta
    name="viewport"
    content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover"
  >

  <title>Glowsome Relationships</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Glowsome Relationships. Nurturing relationships anytime, anywhere."
  >

  <link
    rel="icon"
    type="image/png"
    href="assets/glowie-transparent-curved.png"
  >

  <link
    rel="apple-touch-icon"
    href="assets/glowie-transparent-curved.png"
  >

  <style>
    :root {
      --berry: #bb2853;
      --berry-dark: #a91f49;
      --berry-soft: #ca5875;
      --berry-pale: #f4dce3;

      --ink: #171717;
      --grey: #686868;
      --grey-light: #989898;
      --line: #e7e4e3;

      --white: #ffffff;
      --warm-white: #fdfcfa;
      --warm-grey: #f6f4f2;

      --page-x: clamp(22px, 4.6vw, 78px);
      --content-width: 1640px;

      --ease: cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1);
    }

    *,
    *::before,
    *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      background: var(--warm-white);
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;

      background: var(--warm-white);
      color: var(--ink);

      font-family:
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Segoe UI",
        Helvetica,
        Arial,
        sans-serif;

      font-weight: 400;

      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    }

    body.menu-open {
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    button,
    input {
      font: inherit;
    }

    button {
      color: inherit;
    }

    ::selection {
      background: var(--berry);
      color: white;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(100%, var(--content-width));
      margin-inline: auto;
      padding-inline: var(--page-x);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0;

      color: #888;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.4;

      letter-spacing: .31em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .berry {
      color: var(--berry);
    }

    .italic {
      color: var(--berry);
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .body-large {
      color: var(--grey);

      font-size: clamp(18px, 1.42vw, 25px);
      line-height: 1.55;

      letter-spacing: -.018em;
    }

    .text-link {
      position: relative;

      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 11px;

      width: fit-content;

      padding-bottom: 5px;

      color: #5f5f5f;
      font-size: 17px;

      border-bottom: 1px solid #bfb9b7;

      transition:
        color .25s ease,
        border-color .25s ease;
    }

    .text-link:hover {
      color: var(--berry);
      border-color: var(--berry);
    }

    .text-link .arrow {
      display: inline-block;
      transition: transform .3s var(--ease);
    }

    .text-link:hover .arrow {
      transform: translate(3px, -3px);
    }

    .pill-button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 36px;

      min-width: 250px;

      padding: 20px 25px;

      background: rgba(255,255,255,.76);
      color: var(--ink);

      border: 1px solid rgba(30,30,30,.13);
      border-radius: 999px;

      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);

      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 500;

      transition:
        transform .3s var(--ease),
        border-color .3s ease,
        background .3s ease;
    }

    .pill-button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: rgba(187,40,83,.4);
      background: white;
    }

    .pill-button .arrow {
      transition: transform .3s var(--ease);
    }

    .pill-button:hover .arrow {
      transform: translate(3px, -3px);
    }

    .circle-arrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;

      width: 43px;
      height: 43px;
      flex: 0 0 43px;

      border-radius: 50%;

      background: var(--ink);
      color: white;

      font-size: 16px;

      transition:
        transform .3s var(--ease),
        background .3s ease;
    }

    a:hover .circle-arrow {
      transform: rotate(7deg) translate(2px, -2px);
      background: var(--berry);
    }

    .site-header {
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 1000;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;

      width: 100%;

      transition:
        background .3s ease,
        border-color .3s ease,
        backdrop-filter .3s ease;
    }

    .site-header.scrolled {
      background: rgba(253,252,250,.88);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);

      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.055);
    }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 40px;

      min-height: 104px;
    }

    .brand {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1002;

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;

      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .brand img {
      width: 104px;
      height: auto;
    }

    .desktop-nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: clamp(19px, 2.2vw, 38px);
    }

    .desktop-nav a {
      position: relative;

      padding: 10px 0;

      color: #4e4e4e;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 450;

      white-space: nowrap;

      transition: color .25s ease;
    }

    .desktop-nav a::after {
      content: "";

      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      bottom: 3px;

      width: 100%;
      height: 1px;

      background: var(--berry);

      transform: scaleX(0);
      transform-origin: right;

      transition: transform .35s var(--ease);
    }

    .desktop-nav a:hover,
    .desktop-nav a.active {
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .desktop-nav a:hover::after,
    .desktop-nav a.active::after {
      transform: scaleX(1);
      transform-origin: left;
    }

    .menu-button {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1002;

      display: none;

      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;

      padding: 0;

      background: transparent;
      border: 0;

      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .menu-button span {
      position: absolute;
      left: 8px;

      width: 26px;
      height: 1px;

      background: var(--ink);

      transition:
        transform .35s var(--ease),
        top .35s var(--ease);
    }

    .menu-button span:first-child {
      top: 16px;
    }

    .menu-button span:last-child {
      top: 25px;
    }

    body.menu-open .menu-button span:first-child {
      top: 20px;
      transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    body.menu-open .menu-button span:last-child {
      top: 20px;
      transform: rotate(-45deg);
    }

    .mobile-menu {
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 1001;
      inset: 0;

      display: none;

      background: rgba(253,252,250,.98);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);

      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;

      transition: opacity .35s ease;
    }

    body.menu-open .mobile-menu {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .mobile-menu-inner {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;

      min-height: 100vh;

      padding: 115px var(--page-x) 60px;
    }

    .mobile-menu nav {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 17px;
    }

    .mobile-menu nav a {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 11vw, 66px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -.055em;
    }

    .mobile-menu nav a.active {
      color: var(--berry);
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .scene {
      display: none;

      min-height: 100vh;

      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(9px);
    }

    .scene.active {
      display: block;

      animation: sceneIn .65s var(--ease) forwards;
    }

    @keyframes sceneIn {
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;

      min-height: 100svh;

      padding-top: 104px;

      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero::after {
      content: "";

      position: absolute;

      width: min(76vw, 1000px);
      height: min(76vw, 1000px);

      left: 27%;
      top: 23%;

      border-radius: 50%;

      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at center,
          rgba(190,50,84,.18) 0%,
          rgba(208,98,123,.12) 31%,
          rgba(238,190,201,.07) 51%,
          rgba(255,255,255,0) 72%
        );

      filter: blur(18px);

      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;

      width: 100%;

      padding-top: clamp(70px, 8vh, 120px);
      padding-bottom: clamp(75px, 11vh, 140px);
    }

    .hero .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: clamp(38px, 5vh, 65px);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      max-width: 1280px;

      margin: 0;

      font-size: clamp(64px, 8.2vw, 145px);
      font-weight: 350;
      line-height: .91;

      letter-spacing: -.073em;
    }

    .hero-description {
      max-width: 760px;

      margin: clamp(38px, 5vw, 67px) 0 0;

      color: #606060;

      font-size: clamp(18px, 1.55vw, 27px);
      line-height: 1.55;

      letter-spacing: -.022em;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 31px;

      margin-top: 48px;
    }

    .home-statement {
      padding: clamp(125px, 15vw, 240px) 0;

      background: white;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .home-statement .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 45px;
    }

    .home-statement h2 {
      max-width: 1250px;

      margin: 0;

      font-size: clamp(59px, 7.25vw, 125px);
      font-weight: 350;
      line-height: .96;

      letter-spacing: -.065em;
    }

    .lucie-home {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .96fr 1.04fr;

      min-height: 850px;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--warm-white);
    }

    .lucie-home-copy {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;

      padding:
        clamp(90px, 10vw, 160px)
        var(--page-x);
    }

    .lucie-home-copy .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 37px;
    }

    .lucie-home h2 {
      max-width: 670px;

      margin: 0 0 42px;

      font-size: clamp(53px, 5.2vw, 90px);
      font-weight: 350;
      line-height: .98;

      letter-spacing: -.061em;
    }

    .lucie-home-copy .copy {
      max-width: 650px;
    }

    .lucie-home-copy .copy p {
      margin: 0 0 17px;

      color: var(--grey);

      font-size: clamp(17px, 1.25vw, 21px);
      line-height: 1.62;

      letter-spacing: -.015em;
    }

    .lucie-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 17px;

      width: fit-content;

      margin-top: 30px;

      padding-bottom: 5px;

      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 550;

      border-bottom: 1px solid #c6c2c0;
    }

    .lucie-home-photo {
      position: relative;

      min-height: 720px;

      margin: 29px 29px 29px 0;

      overflow: hidden;

      border-radius: 34px;
      background: #eee9e5;
    }

    .lucie-home-photo img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;

      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
    }

    .reconnection-home {
      padding:
        clamp(120px, 12vw, 190px)
        0
        clamp(100px, 10vw, 160px);

      background: white;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .reconnection-top {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .95fr 1.05fr;
      gap: clamp(50px, 8vw, 130px);
    }

    .reconnection-heading .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 39px;
    }

    .reconnection-heading h2 {
      max-width: 680px;

      margin: 0;

      font-size: clamp(53px, 5.4vw, 94px);
      font-weight: 350;
      line-height: 1;

      letter-spacing: -.06em;
    }

    .reconnection-info {
      padding-top: 2px;
    }

    .reconnection-info > p {
      max-width: 690px;

      margin: 0;

      color: var(--grey);

      font-size: clamp(20px, 1.55vw, 26px);
      line-height: 1.55;

      letter-spacing: -.02em;
    }

    .notify-form {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;

      max-width: 720px;

      margin-top: 50px;

      border-bottom: 1px solid #cfcac8;
    }

    .notify-form input {
      flex: 1;

      min-width: 0;

      padding: 16px 0 17px;

      background: transparent;
      border: 0;
      outline: none;

      color: var(--ink);

      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .notify-form input::placeholder {
      color: #aaa5a3;
    }

    .notify-form button {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;

      padding: 16px 0 17px 18px;

      background: transparent;
      border: 0;

      color: var(--ink);

      font-weight: 600;

      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .notify-feedback {
      min-height: 20px;

      margin-top: 12px;

      color: var(--berry);

      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .course-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 27px;

      margin-top: 95px;
    }

    .course-card {
      position: relative;

      min-height: 330px;

      overflow: hidden;

      border-radius: 27px;

      background:
        radial-gradient(
          ellipse at 50% 45%,
          rgba(255,255,255,1) 0%,
          rgba(247,244,243,1) 25%,
          rgba(228,223,221,.94) 65%,
          rgba(211,207,205,.93) 100%
        );
    }

    .course-card::before {
      content: "";

      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      top: 45%;

      width: 150px;
      height: 110px;

      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-9deg);

      border-radius: 45%;

      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 30% 27%,
          rgba(255,255,255,.95),
          rgba(225,220,217,.45) 52%,
          rgba(255,255,255,0) 74%
        );

      filter: blur(2px);

      box-shadow:
        0 30px 45px rgba(110,100,95,.08);

      opacity: .85;
    }

    .course-card::after {
      content: "";

      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          to top,
          rgba(70,60,55,.14),
          transparent 62%
        );
    }

    .course-card-content {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 2;
      left: 31px;
      bottom: 30px;

      color: white;
    }

    .course-card-content p {
      margin: 0 0 11px;

      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 550;
      letter-spacing: .29em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .course-card-content h3 {
      margin: 0;

      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .reconnection-more {
      margin-top: 36px;
    }

    .page-hero {
      position: relative;

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;

      min-height: 82svh;

      padding-top: 104px;

      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .page-hero::after {
      content: "";

      position: absolute;

      width: 800px;
      height: 800px;

      right: -170px;
      bottom: -250px;

      border-radius: 50%;

      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle,
          rgba(189,43,82,.14),
          rgba(235,185,197,.07) 44%,
          transparent 70%
        );

      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .page-hero-inner {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;

      width: 100%;

      padding-top: clamp(80px, 10vw, 150px);
      padding-bottom: clamp(90px, 11vw, 170px);
    }

    .page-hero .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .page-hero h1 {
      max-width: 1220px;

      margin: 0;

      font-size: clamp(64px, 8vw, 134px);
      font-weight: 350;
      line-height: .94;

      letter-spacing: -.068em;
    }

    .page-hero .intro {
      max-width: 800px;

      margin: 50px 0 0;

      color: var(--grey);

      font-size: clamp(19px, 1.5vw, 25px);
      line-height: 1.55;

      letter-spacing: -.02em;
    }

    .glowie-expanded {
      padding: clamp(90px, 10vw, 160px) 0;
      background: white;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .glowie-expanded-inner {
      max-width: 1020px;
    }

    .glowie-expanded .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 38px;
    }

    .glowie-expanded h2 {
      margin: 0 0 42px;
      max-width: 900px;

      font-size: clamp(46px, 5vw, 80px);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -.055em;
      font-weight: 350;
    }

    .glowie-expanded p {
      margin: 0 0 24px;

      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: clamp(18px, 1.35vw, 22px);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .glowie-benefits {
      margin: 35px 0 40px;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .glowie-benefits li {
      position: relative;

      margin: 0;
      padding: 18px 0 18px 30px;

      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: clamp(18px, 1.35vw, 22px);
      line-height: 1.45;

      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .glowie-benefits li::before {
      content: "•";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 17px;
      color: var(--berry);
    }

    .glowie-intro-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .glowie-block {
      min-height: 680px;

      padding:
        clamp(90px, 9vw, 145px)
        var(--page-x);

      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .glowie-block:last-child {
      border-right: 0;
    }

    .glowie-block .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .glowie-block h2 {
      max-width: 650px;

      margin: 0 0 39px;

      font-size: clamp(48px, 5vw, 83px);
      font-weight: 350;
      line-height: .99;

      letter-spacing: -.058em;
    }

    .glowie-block p {
      max-width: 620px;

      color: var(--grey);

      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.64;
    }

    .knowledge-section {
      padding: clamp(110px, 12vw, 190px) 0;
      background: var(--warm-white);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .knowledge-section .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 38px;
    }

    .knowledge-section h2 {
      max-width: 1000px;

      margin: 0 0 65px;

      font-size: clamp(53px, 6vw, 99px);
      font-weight: 350;
      line-height: .97;
      letter-spacing: -.06em;
    }

    .knowledge-intro {
      max-width: 770px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;

      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: clamp(19px, 1.5vw, 24px);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .knowledge-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0 70px;
      max-width: 1250px;
    }

    .knowledge-item {
      padding: 32px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .knowledge-item h3 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;

      color: var(--berry);
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .knowledge-item p {
      margin: 0;

      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .knowledge-ending {
      max-width: 820px;
      margin-top: 65px;

      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .glowie-download {
      padding:
        clamp(110px, 12vw, 180px)
        0;

      background: var(--berry);
      color: white;
    }

    .glowie-download .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.68);
    }

    .glowie-download h2 {
      max-width: 1130px;

      margin: 0;

      font-size: clamp(59px, 7vw, 117px);
      font-weight: 350;
      line-height: .95;

      letter-spacing: -.065em;
    }

    .glowie-download h2 em {
      color: white;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .download-white {
      margin-top: 50px;

      background: white;
      color: var(--berry);

      border-color: white;
    }

    /* LEGAL PAGES */

    .legal-page {
      padding:
        clamp(165px, 15vw, 230px)
        0
        clamp(110px, 11vw, 180px);

      background: var(--warm-white);
    }

    .legal-inner {
      max-width: 980px;
    }

    .legal-page .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .legal-page h1 {
      max-width: 950px;

      margin: 0 0 24px;

      font-size: clamp(58px, 7vw, 112px);
      font-weight: 350;
      line-height: .95;

      letter-spacing: -.065em;
    }

    .legal-date {
      margin: 0 0 70px;

      color: var(--grey-light);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .legal-content {
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
      margin: 60px 0 20px;

      color: var(--ink);

      font-size: clamp(27px, 2.4vw, 38px);
      font-weight: 450;
      line-height: 1.2;

      letter-spacing: -.035em;
    }

    .legal-content h3 {
      margin: 40px 0 15px;

      color: var(--ink);

      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.35;

      letter-spacing: -.02em;
    }

    .legal-content p {
      margin: 0 0 20px;

      color: var(--grey);

      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.72;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
      margin: 0 0 25px;
      padding-left: 24px;

      color: var(--grey);
    }

    .legal-content li {
      margin-bottom: 10px;

      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .legal-content a {
      color: var(--berry);

      text-decoration: underline;
      text-decoration-color: rgba(187,40,83,.3);
      text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .legal-content a:hover {
      text-decoration-color: var(--berry);
    }

    .legal-summary {
      margin-top: 65px;
      padding: 35px;

      background: var(--berry-pale);

      border-radius: 25px;
    }

    .legal-summary h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .legal-page-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 22px 35px;

      margin-top: 70px;
      padding-top: 35px;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .legal-page-links a {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;

      padding-bottom: 4px;

      color: #5f5f5f;

      font-size: 15px;

      border-bottom: 1px solid #c6c2c0;
    }

    .legal-page-links a:hover {
      color: var(--berry);
      border-color: var(--berry);
    }

    .about-main {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .92fr 1.08fr;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .about-copy {
      padding:
        clamp(90px, 9vw, 150px)
        var(--page-x);
    }

    .about-copy .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 38px;
    }

    .about-copy h2 {
      max-width: 670px;

      margin: 0 0 45px;

      font-size: clamp(52px, 5.4vw, 91px);
      font-weight: 350;
      line-height: .98;

      letter-spacing: -.06em;
    }

    .about-copy p {
      max-width: 690px;

      margin: 0 0 20px;

      color: var(--grey);

      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .about-photo {
      min-height: 850px;

      margin: 30px 30px 30px 0;

      overflow: hidden;

      border-radius: 32px;

      background: #ece8e5;
    }

    .about-photo img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .about-background {
      padding: clamp(110px, 11vw, 180px) 0;
      background: white;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .about-background-header {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin-bottom: 65px;
    }

    .about-background-header .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }

    .about-background-header h2 {
      margin: 0;

      font-size: clamp(53px, 6vw, 100px);
      font-weight: 350;
      line-height: .97;
      letter-spacing: -.06em;
    }

    .about-background-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr .8fr;
      gap: clamp(60px, 8vw, 130px);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .about-background-copy p {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 0 23px;

      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .about-second-photo {
      position: sticky;
      top: 135px;

      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: var(--warm-grey);
    }

    .about-second-photo img {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .memberships {
      margin-top: 55px;
      padding-top: 35px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .memberships h3,
    .education-section h3 {
      margin: 0 0 25px;

      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 450;
      letter-spacing: -.025em;
    }

    .memberships ul,
    .education-list {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .memberships li {
      padding: 11px 0;
      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .education-section {
      padding: clamp(100px, 10vw, 160px) 0;
      background: var(--warm-white);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .education-section h2 {
      max-width: 1050px;
      margin: 0 0 65px;

      font-size: clamp(45px, 5vw, 82px);
      line-height: 1.03;
      font-weight: 350;
      letter-spacing: -.055em;
    }

    .education-list {
      max-width: 1000px;
    }

    .education-list li {
      position: relative;

      padding: 19px 0 19px 27px;

      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.6;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .education-list li::before {
      content: "—";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--berry);
    }

    .reconnection-page-content {
      padding:
        clamp(100px, 10vw, 155px)
        0;

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: white;
    }

    .reconnection-page-content .course-grid {
      margin-top: 70px;
    }

    .contact-page {
      min-height: 100svh;
      padding-top: 104px;
    }

    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;

      min-height: calc(100svh - 104px);
    }

    .contact-heading {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;

      padding:
        clamp(80px, 10vw, 150px)
        var(--page-x);

      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .contact-heading .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 38px;
    }

    .contact-heading h1 {
      max-width: 720px;

      margin: 0;

      font-size: clamp(62px, 7vw, 120px);
      font-weight: 350;
      line-height: .94;

      letter-spacing: -.066em;
    }

    .contact-details {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;

      padding:
        clamp(80px, 10vw, 150px)
        var(--page-x);
    }

    .contact-details p {
      margin: 0 0 36px;

      color: var(--grey);

      font-size: clamp(20px, 1.55vw, 26px);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .contact-email {
      display: inline-block;

      width: fit-content;

      margin-bottom: 48px;

      color: var(--berry);

      font-size: clamp(30px, 3vw, 49px);
      font-weight: 350;
      letter-spacing: -.04em;

      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(187,40,83,.34);
    }

    .site-footer {
      position: relative;

      min-height: 510px;

      overflow: hidden;

      background: var(--warm-white);

      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .footer-top {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;

      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 50px;

      padding-top: 72px;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 36px;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 520;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: var(--berry);
    }

    .footer-copyright {
      margin: 0;

      color: #969696;

      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .footer-word {
      position: absolute;

      left: -1.5vw;
      bottom: -3.3vw;

      color: #efedec;

      font-size: 17vw;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: .72;

      letter-spacing: -.07em;
      white-space: nowrap;

      user-select: none;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1050px) {
      .desktop-nav {
        display: none;
      }

      .menu-button {
        display: block;
      }

      .mobile-menu {
        display: block;
      }

      .lucie-home,
      .about-main {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .lucie-home-photo,
      .about-photo {
        min-height: 680px;
        margin:
          0
          var(--page-x)
          var(--page-x);
      }

      .reconnection-top {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 55px;
      }

      .glowie-intro-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .glowie-block {
        min-height: auto;
        border-right: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .knowledge-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .about-background-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .about-second-photo {
        position: relative;
        top: auto;
        max-width: 650px;
      }

      .contact-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .contact-heading {
        border-right: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .header-inner {
        min-height: 82px;
      }

      .brand img {
        width: 83px;
      }

      .hero,
      .page-hero {
        padding-top: 82px;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 92svh;
      }

      .hero-content {
        padding-top: 75px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(58px, 16vw, 90px);
        line-height: .94;
      }

      .hero-description {
        font-size: 18px;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .pill-button {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .home-statement h2 {
        font-size: clamp(53px, 14vw, 80px);
      }

      .lucie-home-copy {
        padding-top: 100px;
        padding-bottom: 60px;
      }

      .lucie-home-photo,
      .about-photo {
        min-height: 510px;
      }

      .reconnection-home {
        padding-top: 105px;
      }

      .course-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 18px;

        margin-top: 60px;
      }

      .course-card {
        min-height: 300px;
      }

      .notify-form {
        align-items: flex-end;
      }

      .notify-form button {
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .page-hero {
        min-height: 72svh;
      }

      .page-hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(58px, 15vw, 88px);
      }

      .legal-page {
        padding:
          135px
          0
          90px;
      }

      .legal-page h1 {
        font-size: clamp(53px, 14vw, 78px);
      }

      .legal-date {
        margin-bottom: 50px;
      }

      .legal-content p,
      .legal-content li {
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .legal-summary {
        padding: 25px;
        border-radius: 20px;
      }

      .contact-page {
        padding-top: 82px;
      }

      .contact-grid {
        min-height: calc(100svh - 82px);
      }

      .footer-top {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .footer-word {
        font-size: 23vw;
        bottom: 0;
      }

      .site-footer {
        min-height: 390px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .eyebrow {
        font-size: 10px;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        gap: 22px;
      }

      .lucie-home-photo,
      .about-photo {
        min-height: 430px;
        border-radius: 22px;
      }

      .course-card {
        border-radius: 20px;
      }

      .footer-links {
        gap: 20px 27px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        animation-duration: .01ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        transition-duration: .01ms !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header class="site-header" id="siteHeader">
    <div class="header-inner container">

      <a
        href="#home"
        class="brand"
        data-page="home"
        aria-label="Glowsome Relationships home"
      >
        <img
          src="assets/DCB3BB74-840F-48D5-A076-90D64A282AE4.png"
          alt="Glowsome Relationships"
        >
      </a>

      <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#home" data-page="home">Home</a>
        <a href="#glowie" data-page="glowie">Glowie</a>
        <a href="#about" data-page="about">About Lucie</a>
        <a href="#reconnection" data-page="reconnection">
          Reconnection Project
        </a>
        <a href="#contact" data-page="contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>

      <button
        class="menu-button"
        id="menuButton"
        aria-label="Open navigation"
        aria-expanded="false"
        aria-controls="mobileMenu"
      >
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
      </button>

    </div>
  </header>


  <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="mobile-menu-inner">

      <nav aria-label="Mobile navigation">
        <a href="#home" data-page="home">Home</a>
        <a href="#glowie" data-page="glowie">Glowie</a>
        <a href="#about" data-page="about">About Lucie</a>
        <a href="#reconnection" data-page="reconnection">
          Reconnection Project
        </a>
        <a href="#contact" data-page="contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>

    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- HOME -->

  <section
    class="scene active"
    id="home"
    data-scene="home"
  >

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content container">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          A place to navigate your relationship
        </p>

        <h1>
          Meet <span class="italic">Glowie.</span><br>
          Your calm companion.
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-description">
          A gentle daily app that allows you to tap into broader perspectives
          about what you are experiencing in your relationship. Unlike your
          therapist, Glowie is available 24/7.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">

          <a
            href="#glowie"
            class="pill-button"
            data-page="glowie"
          >
            <span>What can Glowie do?</span>
            <span class="arrow">↗</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="mailto:glowie@glowsome.com?subject=Glowie%20availability"
            class="text-link"
            title="Ask about Glowie availability"
          >
            <span>Download Glowie</span>
            <span class="arrow">↗</span>
          </a>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="home-statement">
      <div class="container">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          Glowsome Relationships
        </p>

        <h2>
          Nurturing relationships<br>
          <span class="italic">anytime, anywhere.</span>
        </h2>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="lucie-home">

      <div class="lucie-home-copy">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          Behind the scenes
        </p>

        <h2>
          Who built Glowie
          <span class="italic">and why?</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="copy">

          <p>
            My name is Lucie Rust and I created Glowie based on my knowledge
            as a systemic couples psychotherapist and coach based in Prague,
            working with clients from all over the world.
          </p>

          <p>
            After years of working with individuals and couples on themes of
            intimacy, relationships and emotional well-being, I noticed a
            recurring gap: the space between therapy sessions, where people
            are left alone with their thoughts, questions and feelings,
            without a safe place to explore them.
          </p>

          <p>
            Glowie was built to fill that space. She is a warm, non-directive
            AI companion grounded in systemic therapy principles, designed to
            support self-reflection, emotional exploration and deeper
            self-understanding.
          </p>

        </div>

        <a
          href="#about"
          class="lucie-link"
          data-page="about"
        >
          <span>More about Lucie</span>
          <span class="circle-arrow">↗</span>
        </a>

      </div>

      <div class="lucie-home-photo">
        <img
          src="assets/4-IMG_3889-Edit-top-denoise-faceai-Edit.jpg"
          alt="Lucie Rust"
        >
      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="reconnection-home">

      <div class="container">

        <div class="reconnection-top">

          <div class="reconnection-heading">

            <p class="eyebrow">
              The Reconnection Project
            </p>

            <h2>
              An academy is
              <span class="italic">growing.</span>
            </h2>

          </div>

          <div class="reconnection-info">

            <p>
              Guided courses to help you build meaningful relationships,
              step by step. Leave your email and we'll let you know the
              moment doors open.
            </p>

            <form
              class="notify-form"
              data-email-signup
            >
              <input
                type="email"
                name="email"
                placeholder="your@email.com"
                aria-label="Email address"
                autocomplete="email"
                required
              >

              <button type="submit">
                Notify me
                <span>→</span>
              </button>
            </form>

            <div
              class="notify-feedback"
              aria-live="polite"
            ></div>

          </div>
        </div>


        <div class="course-grid">

          <article class="course-card">
            <div class="course-card-content">
              <p>Coming soon</p>
              <h3>Module 1</h3>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="course-card">
            <div class="course-card-content">
              <p>Coming soon</p>
              <h3>Module 2</h3>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="course-card">
            <div class="course-card-content">
              <p>Coming soon</p>
              <h3>Module 3</h3>
            </div>
          </article>

        </div>


        <div class="reconnection-more">
          <a
            href="#reconnection"
            class="text-link"
            data-page="reconnection"
          >
            Explore the Reconnection Project
            <span class="arrow">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

  </section>


  <!-- GLOWIE -->

  <section
    class="scene"
    id="glowie"
    data-scene="glowie"
  >

    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="page-hero-inner container">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          Meet Glowie
        </p>

        <h1>
          A calm space to explore
          <span class="italic">your relationship.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="intro">
          Glowie is a warm, non-directive AI companion grounded in
          systemic therapy principles. She helps you slow down, explore
          what you are experiencing and see your situation from broader
          perspectives.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="glowie-expanded">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="glowie-expanded-inner">

          <p class="eyebrow">
            Your journey
          </p>

          <h2>
            Gentle, curious
            <span class="italic">dialogue.</span>
          </h2>

          <p>
            Glowie accompanies you on your journey of self-discovery through
            gentle, curious dialogue. She helps you:
          </p>

          <ul class="glowie-benefits">
            <li>Recognize recurring relationship patterns and their roots</li>
            <li>Deepen understanding of your emotions and bodily signals</li>
            <li>Find new perspectives in challenging situations</li>
            <li>Cultivate a kinder relationship with yourself and others</li>
            <li>Integrate therapy insights into your daily life</li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            Unlike ordinary chatbots, Glowie works systemically – seeing you
            as the expert on your own life, asking open, reflective questions,
            and supporting your own discoveries without instructions or
            "right answers.”
          </p>

          <p>
            Your conversations with Glowie remain completely private.
            Information you share is only used to personalize your experience.
            It's not shared with third parties or used for purposes other than
            providing this service.
          </p>

          <p>
            Unlike me, she's available whenever you need space for reflection,
            between sessions, or when seeking support processing new insights.
          </p>

          <p>
            Glowie isn't a replacement for therapy, but a valuable guide
            extending the therapeutic space beyond our meetings and supporting
            the continuity of your growth.
          </p>

          <p>
            Join the community of clients already discovering deeper layers of
            self-understanding with Glowie's compassionate support.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="glowie-intro-grid">

      <div class="glowie-block">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          What Glowie can do
        </p>

        <h2>
          A space to notice,
          question and
          <span class="italic">understand.</span>
        </h2>

        <p>
          Glowie can help you reflect on patterns in your relationships,
          explore different perspectives, put words to feelings and think
          more deeply about the way you connect with yourself and others.
        </p>

        <p>
          She can ask reflective questions, help you pause in emotionally
          charged moments and give you a private place to explore thoughts
          that may still feel unfinished.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="glowie-block">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          What Glowie cannot do
        </p>

        <h2>
          Glowie is a companion.
          She is not a
          <span class="italic">therapist.</span>
        </h2>

        <p>
          Glowie does not diagnose, provide medical or psychological
          treatment, make decisions for you or replace professional therapy.
        </p>

        <p>
          She is designed to support reflection, not to tell you what to do.
          If you need professional or urgent support, you should contact an
          appropriate qualified professional or emergency service.
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>    <section class="knowledge-section">
      <div class="container">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          The thinking behind Glowie
        </p>

        <h2>
          Grounded in systemic
          <span class="italic">therapy principles.</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="knowledge-intro">
          Glowie is designed around a systemic understanding of relationships.
          Rather than looking for simple causes or quick fixes, she encourages
          curiosity about the wider patterns, contexts and connections that
          shape how we experience ourselves and one another.
        </p>


        <div class="knowledge-grid">

          <article class="knowledge-item">
            <h3>Curiosity over judgement</h3>
            <p>
              Glowie approaches your experiences with curiosity rather than
              deciding what is right or wrong. The aim is to create room for
              reflection, not judgement.
            </p>
          </article>


          <article class="knowledge-item">
            <h3>Multiple perspectives</h3>
            <p>
              Relationships rarely have one single truth. Glowie can help you
              consider different viewpoints and notice how the same situation
              might be understood in more than one way.
            </p>
          </article>


          <article class="knowledge-item">
            <h3>Patterns and connections</h3>
            <p>
              Instead of treating moments in isolation, Glowie encourages you
              to notice recurring patterns and how thoughts, feelings,
              behaviours and relationships influence one another.
            </p>
          </article>


          <article class="knowledge-item">
            <h3>You remain the expert</h3>
            <p>
              Glowie does not position herself as the authority on your life.
              Her role is to support your exploration so that your own
              understanding can develop.
            </p>
          </article>


          <article class="knowledge-item">
            <h3>Questions rather than instructions</h3>
            <p>
              Glowie is designed to ask thoughtful, open questions rather than
              give prescriptive advice or tell you what you should do.
            </p>
          </article>


          <article class="knowledge-item">
            <h3>Space between sessions</h3>
            <p>
              Reflection does not only happen during therapy. Glowie provides
              a space to continue exploring thoughts, emotions and discoveries
              whenever they arise.
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>


        <p class="knowledge-ending">
          Glowie is not designed to replace the human relationship at the
          heart of therapy. She offers another space for reflection, helping
          you stay connected to your own process between conversations.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="glowie-download">
      <div class="container">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          Glowie
        </p>

        <h2>
          Your relationship doesn't stop
          between conversations.
