  <!-- ABOUT LUCIE -->

  <section
    class="scene"
    id="about"
    data-scene="about"
  >

    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="page-hero-inner container">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          About Lucie
        </p>

        <h1>
          Relationships are where
          we meet ourselves
          <span class="italic">most deeply.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="intro">
          I work with individuals and couples who want to understand
          themselves and their relationships more deeply, particularly when
          familiar patterns no longer seem to work.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="about-main">

      <div class="about-copy">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          My approach
        </p>

        <h2>
          A space for
          <span class="italic">curiosity.</span>
        </h2>

        <p>
          My name is Lucie Rust. I am a systemic couples psychotherapist and
          coach based in Prague, working with clients from all over the world.
        </p>

        <p>
          My work focuses on relationships, intimacy, emotional well-being and
          the patterns that shape how we connect with ourselves and with the
          people closest to us.
        </p>

        <p>
          I believe that meaningful change often begins not with finding the
          right answer, but with becoming curious about the questions we have
          stopped asking.
        </p>

        <p>
          Systemic therapy offers a way of looking beyond the individual in
          isolation. It explores relationships, contexts, histories and the
          patterns that develop between people over time.
        </p>

        <p>
          Rather than telling you what to do, my role is to create a space
          where new perspectives can emerge and where you can develop a deeper
          understanding of your own experience.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="about-photo">
        <img
          src="assets/4-IMG_3889-Edit-top-denoise-faceai-Edit.jpg"
          alt="Lucie Rust"
        >
      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="about-background">

      <div class="container">

        <div class="about-background-header">

          <p class="eyebrow">
            Behind the work
          </p>

          <h2>
            Experience, training and
            <span class="italic">continued learning.</span>
          </h2>

        </div>


        <div class="about-background-layout">

          <div class="about-background-copy">

            <p>
              My professional background combines systemic psychotherapy,
              couples work and coaching, with a particular interest in how
              relationships shape our sense of self and how patterns can
              change when they are understood differently.
            </p>

            <p>
              I work with people from different cultures, backgrounds and
              stages of life. My international practice has strengthened my
              belief that there is rarely one correct way to understand a
              relationship. Context matters, culture matters and the meanings
              we give to our experiences matter.
            </p>

            <p>
              I continue to develop my practice through supervision, further
              training and engagement with current thinking in systemic and
              relationship therapy.
            </p>


            <div class="memberships">

              <h3>
                Professional memberships
              </h3>

              <ul>
                <li>
                  Professional systemic psychotherapy and counselling
                  affiliations
                </li>

                <li>
                  Ongoing professional supervision and continuing education
                </li>

                <li>
                  International practice with individuals and couples
                </li>
              </ul>

            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="about-second-photo">
            <img
              src="assets/4-IMG_3889-Edit-top-denoise-faceai-Edit.jpg"
              alt="Lucie Rust"
            >
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="education-section">

      <div class="container">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          Training
        </p>

        <h2>
          A practice shaped by
          <span class="italic">learning and reflection.</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="education-list">

          <ul class="education-list">

            <li>
              Systemic psychotherapy and relationship-focused therapeutic
              training
            </li>

            <li>
              Couples therapy and work with relationship dynamics
            </li>

            <li>
              Coaching and reflective practice
            </li>

            <li>
              Continued professional development, supervision and specialist
              training
            </li>

          </ul>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

  </section>


